# Design System

## Tailwind v4 Setup

```css
/* index.css */
@import "tailwindcss";
@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));
```

Dark mode is **class-based** – `ToggleTheme` toggles `"dark"` on `document.documentElement` and persists to `localStorage("theme")`.
Always pair every color with its dark variant:

```jsx
// ✅ Always paired
className="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] text-gray-800 dark:text-white border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
```

## Background Tokens

| Surface | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| Page (home) | `bg-[#f0efe7]` | `dark:bg-gradient-to-br dark:from-[#121212] dark:to-black` |
| Page (profile/other) | `bg-[#f3f2ef]` | `dark:bg-[#1a1a1a]` |
| Navbar | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-[#1e1e1e]` |
| Cards / main panels | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-[#1a1a1a]` or `dark:bg-[#1c1c1c]` |
| Secondary panels | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-[#2a2a2a]` |
| Dropdowns / modals | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-[#2c2c2c]` |
| Chat messages area | `bg-gray-50` | `dark:bg-[#121212]` |
| Input fields | `bg-gray-100` | `dark:bg-gray-800` |

## Brand Color Tokens

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Primary | `#2dc0ff` / `#24b2ff` / `#18c5ff` | Active nav, CTA borders, link color |
| Primary hover bg light | `hover:bg-blue-50` | Button hover |
| Primary hover bg dark | `dark:hover:bg-[#083047]` or `dark:hover:bg-[#223344]` | Button hover dark |
| Destructive | `#ec4545` | Sign out, delete |
| Destructive hover dark | `dark:hover:bg-[#4a1f1f]` | Sign out dark hover |
| AI / Generate | `text-purple-600` | AI action buttons |
| AI hover | `hover:bg-purple-100 dark:hover:bg-purple-900` | AI button hover |

## Profile Image Ring (canonical pattern)

```jsx
<div className="w-[80px] h-[80px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-400 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 p-[2px] shadow-lg">
  <div className="w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
    <img src={user.profileImage || emptyDp} alt="" className="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full" />
  </div>
</div>
```

Common ring sizes: `w-10 h-10` · `w-12 h-12` · `w-16 h-16` · `w-[80px] h-[80px]`

## Button Variants

```jsx
// Primary outline (most common)
"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-[#2dc0ff] text-[#2dc0ff] hover:bg-blue-50 dark:hover:bg-[#083047] transition font-medium"

// Primary filled
"rounded-full bg-[#24b2ff] hover:bg-[#1ca2e5] text-white font-semibold transition"

// Gradient filled (hero/chatbot)
"rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-600 text-white hover:shadow-md transition"

// Destructive outline
"rounded-full border border-[#ec4545] text-[#ec4545] hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-[#4a1f1f] transition"
```

## Layout Rules

- Navbar: `fixed top-0 h-[70px] z-50` → all pages need `pt-[80px]` to clear it.
- Homepage 3-col: `w-full lg:w-[25%]` left + `w-full lg:w-[50%]` center + `w-full lg:w-[25%]` right.
- Profile page: single centered column `max-w-[900px] px-4`.
- Modals: `fixed z-[200]` content + `fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-black opacity-60 z-[100]` overlay.
- Chatbot: `fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50`.

